&lt;p&gt;We maintain a strict no-tolerance stance against any form of discrimination and harassment, ensuring all individuals are treated equitably, irrespective of their race, ethnicity, religion, beliefs, age, sex, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, disability, marital or pregnancy status, genetic background, or any other attribute safeguarded under our company policies or federal, state or local laws and legislation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to ensure that our hiring process is accessible. If you need reasonable accommodation for any part of the application process, please send an email to &lt;a ---------- with the nature of your request.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to transparency about how we collect and use your data, including ensuring we comply with legal obligations relating to data protection. You can view our data privacy policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hanovercomms.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hanover is part of AVENIR GLOBAL’s powerhouse of specialist communications consultancies across EMEA and North America. Collectively we rank among the top 15 largest communication firms in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hanovercomms.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;Hanover&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hanovercomms.com/careers/&quot;&gt;working for us&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working as a Senior Growth Manager supporting Reddit’s International Community team, you will develop and execute initiatives that strengthen Reddit’s user and community ecosystems in the US and across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is open to candidates based in the UK or the US - East Coast.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a marketing role. You will identify high-impact growth opportunities, design and execute experiments, and develop successful interventions into repeatable models that can be applied across markets. Your work may include building and scaling communities, increasing the supply of relevant content and contributions, reaching underserved audiences, and strengthening Reddit’s user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines growth strategy, hands-on experimentation, data analysis, and cross-functional influence. You will work closely with Product, Data Science, Marketing, and Community teams while maintaining the autonomy and entrepreneurial mindset required to scale successful initiatives to other markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User &amp;amp; Community Growth Strategies: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish and execute comprehensive strategies to grow the user base and nurture communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute growth experiments aimed at addressing gaps in content supply, community density, contribution, discovery, engagement, and user growth. Apply a creative, entrepreneurial approach by testing ideas quickly, learning from results, and iterating accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling and Repeatability:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate successful experiments into repeatable playbooks, processes, and recommendations that can be applied across markets. Determine which elements can scale broadly, which require local adaptation, and what operational or product support is needed to unlock broader impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance Analytics: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor key growth and ecosystem indicators, including DAU, contribution, content supply, community health, and retention. Analyze performance trends, identify risks and opportunities, and establish clear measurement frameworks for experiments and scaled programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with various internal teams to provide insights, shape priorities, and scale growth initiatives. Build compelling evidence through experimentation to influence cross-functional investment and product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in user growth, product operations, or market expansion, with a demonstrated track record of executing growth initiatives at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong entrepreneurial instincts, hands-on execution skills, and the ability to make progress independently in ambiguous or resource-constrained environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven and analytical mindset, with proficiency in Excel modeling, working knowledge of SQL, and experience creating scalable processes and automations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking, with the ability to distinguish between market-specific problems and growth opportunities that can be addressed through repeatable approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively and align cross-functional stakeholders across global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented mindset, strong attention to detail, and a bias toward execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort balancing a portfolio of opportunities across the US and international markets and prioritizing based on potential impact, feasibility, and strategic relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Remote is solving modern organizations’ biggest challenge – navigating global employment compliantly with ease. We make it possible for businesses of all sizes to recruit, pay, and manage international teams. With our core values at heart and future focused work culture, our team works tirelessly on ambitious problems, asynchronously, around the world. You can find Remoters working from 6 different continents (Antarctica left to go!) and all of our positions are fully remote.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-2f7cb4da-dab4-8068-a80f-001c50b2d808 suggestion-update notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;With Innovation as one of the core values, we have built Automation and AI capabilities into the requirements for every role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We encourage every member of the Remote team to bring their talents, experiences and culture to the table to help us build the best-in-class HR platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are energetic, curious, motivated and ambitious, be part of our world. Apply now and define the future of work!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a senior partnerships leader to own the commercial success and ongoing relationship with a portfolio of Remote’s most strategic embedded partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person will be responsible for driving bookings &amp;amp; ARR across partner-sold and partner-sourced motions (quota carrying). They will own the revenue line for these partnerships and will be accountable for making the partnerships successful commercially, operationally, and strategically.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role sits at the intersection of partner relationship management, sales leadership, go-to-market execution, and cross-functional orchestration. The primary focus is commercial: helping partners generate demand, enable their sellers, close deals, improve conversion, and build repeatable motions that allow them to sell Remote products increasingly independently. At the same time, this person will be the senior relationship owner for the partner, responsible for partnership health, executive engagement, issue resolution, and long-term expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a “manage the partner relationship and hope revenue follows” role. It is a commercial leadership role where the partnership relationship exists in service of revenue growth, partner independence, and long-term embedded success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptionally sharp business judgement. You can understand the business objectives and stakeholder dynamics of a complex partner organization, and translate that to concrete actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator and evangelist. You can create and consistently communicate the partnership value message within the partner organization and Remote.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operating rigor: you can turn ambiguity into repeatable plans, cadences, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence: you feel comfortable dealing with C-level execs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dare to dive deep: you operate cross-functionally with ease; you don’t shy away from detailed discussions with product, engineering, legal or compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal maker: you create proposals ‘you can say yes to’ that create long term sustainable economics for both parties. You are able to be firm when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage through influence: you are able to work with large strategic partners where success depends on influencing another company’s sales, marketing, product, and leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, hiring and managing a high-performance team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel 20–40%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning revenue motions and owning a number. You own outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in top-tier consulting, finance, or big tech - and in B2B tech startups/scaleups. You have the big and the small.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating new businesses, product, or sales motion. You build new systems, don’t just operate within them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points for experience in HR Tech, Fin Tech, or Embedded partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own commercial outcomes for strategic embedded partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio of Remote’s largest embedded HR technology partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry an annual bookings target of $10M+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for the commercial performance of the partnership, including pipeline generation, conversion, bookings, ARR, ASP, retention, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute partner account plans that translate strategic partnership potential into measurable revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where revenue is blocked, where and why performance is below potential, and what needs to change across partner GTM, Remote GTM, product, process, enablement, pricing, or operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage commercial exceptions, pricing escalations, deal support, and channel conflicts where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Make partners independently successful&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help partner sellers become increasingly independent in generating, qualifying, selling, and closing Remote opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable partner sales motions across partner-sold, partner-sourced, and co-sold opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with partner sales leaders to embed Remote into their teams’ priorities, workflows, sales processes, and incentives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with enablement, solutions consulting, partner marketing, and embedded sales teams to ensure partner sellers know what to sell, how to sell it, and when to bring Remote in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a clear path from Remote-supported selling to partner-led selling, with the goal of reducing unnecessary dependency on Remote while improving commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead senior partner relationships&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the overall relationship health with strategic embedded partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior / C-level stakeholders within the partner organization across sales, marketing, product, operations, and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep partners engaged, motivated, and accountable to the joint commercial plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unblock issues that slow down revenue growth or damage partner confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run structured business reviews with clear performance insights, decisions, next steps, and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the partner sees Remote as a critical strategic partner, not just another integration or referral option.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Define the embedded partner GTM model across the partner portfolio&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, test, and optimize sales motions across partner-sold, partner-sourced, and co-sold models. Turn successful experiments into repeatable playbooks that can be used across partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create playbooks for demand generation, enablement, sales process, partner seller activation, deal support, QBRs, and partner performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and influence partners to implement best practices for demand generation and embedded sales in their own organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify friction between channels and work with Sales, Partnerships, RevOps, and leadership to resolve it. Share learnings so that Remote gets better with every partnership, not just within one account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to expand existing embedded partnerships into new products, markets, customer segments, regions, or sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Manage and develop a high performing team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of partner account managers and embedded sales leads supporting the partner portfolio. Set clear priorities, operating rhythms, and performance expectations for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach the team to balance short-term deal support with the longer-term goal of making partner sellers more independent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Orchestrate Remote cross-functionally&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the commercial and relationship orchestrator across Remote for the partner portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Solution Architecture, Partner Marketing, Solutions Consulting, Legal, Compliance, Operations, CX, Implementation, RevOps, and Partner Success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure internal stakeholders understand the commercial priorities, partner context, trade-offs, and urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate clearly when decisions, resources, product changes, or executive support are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Practicals&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote Embedded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting line:&lt;/strong&gt; GM Remote Embedded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; North America or Western Europe. The best timezones for this role are US Eastern Time or UK time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; 20–40% within North America and Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roughly 3 hours across 4 weeks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with future manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with team members (no managers present)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Veremark-Remote-96e108c037b8423cbd4c3f07a1f9b38b?d=41ac176d9f0f490b83d7bf56dcd5bf11#aeb36272c9bd49b1b490f2ae7fc76552&quot;&gt;Prior employment verification check&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/people-Total-Rewards-1945bce8d3924ece9421ba8630f57b0c&quot;&gt;Total Rewards philosophy&lt;/a&gt; is to ensure fair, unbiased compensation and fair &lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1691622878&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-level-1 discussion-id-f2a82bc4-09e4-4a71-ad93-755b1d26a690 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt; pay &lt;/span&gt;along with competitive benefits in all locations in which we operate. We do not agree to or encourage cheap-labor practices and therefore we ensure to pay above in-location rates. We hope to inspire other companies to support global talent-hiring and bring local wealth to developing countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At first glance our salary bands seem quite wide - here is some context. At Remote we have international operations and a globally distributed workforce.&amp;nbsp; We use geo ranges to consider geographic pay differentials as part of our global compensation strategy to remain competitive in various markets while we hiring globally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role, level and location, and our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay for the successful candidate in this role is dependent upon many factors such as location, transferable or job-related skills, work experience, relevant training, business needs, and market demands. The base salary range may be subject to change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;At Remote, we foster internal mobility as a key element of our culture of employee growth and development, supported by a compensation philosophy that guarantees pay equity and fairness. Therefore, all compensation changes associated with an internal move will be reviewed by the Total Rewards &amp;amp; People Enablement team on a case by case basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual salary range for this full-time position is&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$252,050&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$425,300 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our full benefits &amp;amp; perks are explained in our handbook at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote.com/r/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. As a global company, each country works differently, but some benefits/perks are for all Remoters:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;work from anywhere&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;flexible paid time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;flexible working hours (we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://remote.com/async&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Working-Async-at-Remote-80c01cd443ad4c77a8ceaef7c5fba5d0&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;async&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;16 weeks paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;budget towards &lt;a href=&quot;https://app.notion.com/p/remotecom/Benefits-Perks-1e48a5869c274f40910b76d405b92f63?source=copy_link#3accb4dadab48025b7a6dbc23bc47504&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;co-working spaces, learning and wellness&lt;/a&gt; (including gym memberships)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;mental health support services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;stock options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;home office budget &amp;amp; IT equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll plan your day (and life)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We work async at Remote which means you can plan your schedule around your life (and not around meetings). Read more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://remote.com/async&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;remote.com/async&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will be empowered to take ownership and be proactive. When in doubt you will default to action instead of waiting. Your &lt;strong&gt;life-work balance&lt;/strong&gt; is important and you will be encouraged to put yourself and your family first, and fit work around your needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If that sounds like something you want, apply now!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please fill out the form below and upload your CV with a PDF format.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;We kindly ask you to submit your application and CV in English, as this is the standardised language we use here at Remote.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you don’t have an up to date CV but you are still interested in talking to us, please feel free to add a copy of your LinkedIn profile instead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Not only do we encourage folks from all ethnic groups, genders, sexuality, age, abilities, disability status and any other under-represented group to apply, but we prioritize a sense of belonging. We have 4 ERGs (Women, Disability, Queer, Minorities in Tech) who meet regularly with the People team. During your interviews and beyond, we ask &amp;amp; encourage anybody who needs an accommodation to request one from their recruiter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We will ask you to voluntarily tell us your pronouns at interview stage, and you will have the option to answer our anonymous demographic questionnaire when you apply below. As an equal employment opportunity employer it’s important to us that our workforce reflects people of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences and this data will help us to stay accountable. We thank you for providing this data, if you chose to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Remote, we embrace AI as a valuable tool while prioritizing human creativity and authenticity.&amp;nbsp;We look forward to meeting candidates who balance innovation with genuine expertise and experience.&amp;nbsp;To learn more about Remote&#39;s AI guidelines check see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Guidelines-on-using-AI-when-applying-for-a-job-at-Remote-11ccb4dadab4805f80a7c73b6567bd8f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Guidelines-on-using-AI-when-applying-for-a-job-at-Remote-11ccb4dadab4805f80a7c73b6567bd8f&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1733927526443000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sIVooKuyGfRra1PtGXreV&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note we accept applications on an ongoing basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to scale our business across EMEA, we are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Solutions Architecture Senior Manager, EMEA&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our customer-facing Solutions Architecture organization across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a leadership role responsible for building, developing and scaling a high-performing Solutions Architecture organization across multiple countries and markets. You will partner closely with EMEA Sales leadership, establish the operating model for the regional team, and ensure our Solutions Architects consistently deliver outstanding technical leadership and business value to customers. The scope of the role reflects where the business is today; as we scale, we expect the organization to specialize and subdivide, and this leader will help shape and staff that evolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced people leader who can build and empower strong teams while remaining close to customers, technology and our most strategic opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re welcome to work remotely from &lt;strong&gt;Europe&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead and coach a high-performing Solutions Architecture team across multiple countries and markets in EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Solutions Architecture engagement model for EMEA in close partnership with regional Sales leadership, including how coverage and ownership are divided as the team expands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear priorities, operating mechanisms and performance expectations across the regional Solutions Architecture organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale the organization as the business grows, including hiring, coaching and developing senior technical professionals and future leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with CIOs, CTOs, Heads of Infrastructure, Heads of AI/ML, Business leaders and other senior stakeholders across strategic customers and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the voice of EMEA customers internally and provide guidance for Nebius&#39;s Product and Technology roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven &lt;strong&gt;people-management experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including hiring, coaching and developing senior technical professionals and leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of &lt;strong&gt;leading customer-facing technical teams across EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience managing teams distributed across multiple countries and markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building, scaling and operating regional Solutions Architecture, Sales Engineering, Customer Engineering or similar technical organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;player-coach mentality&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to operate effectively at both leadership and execution levels — from organizational strategy and talent development to direct engagement in strategic customer opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the EMEA technology market and the ability to operate effectively across different countries, cultures, customer segments and levels of market maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively across both the &lt;strong&gt;technical and business dimensions&lt;/strong&gt; of complex customer engagements and influence C-level and senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive communication, presentation and stakeholder-management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a fast-growing environment where team structures, coverage boundaries and scope of ownership will continue to evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cloud-native infrastructure, including compute, storage, networking, security and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership experience within a &lt;strong&gt;public cloud, hyperscaler or rapidly scaling cloud infrastructure organization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;GPU-based infrastructure workloads and accelerated computing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or supporting &lt;strong&gt;machine learning and AI workloads&lt;/strong&gt;, including training and inference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of distributed AI/ML infrastructure and the compute, networking and storage considerations associated with large-scale GPU workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes-based AI/ML platforms, MLOps or AI infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience helping customers evaluate the economics of large-scale compute or GPU workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
