&lt;p&gt;At JetBrains, code is our passion. Ever since we started, back in 2000, we have been striving to make the strongest, most effective developer tools on earth. By automating routine checks and corrections, our tools speed up production, freeing developers and businesses to grow, discover, and create.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IntelliJ IDEA revolutionized the Java development tool market back in 2001, becoming the first IDE to offer automated code refactoring. It continues to drive innovation in software development, making thousands of programmers more productive every day. In addition to Java, IntelliJ IDEA includes various development tools for other prominent languages such as Ruby, Groovy, Scala, Python, JavaScript, Objective-C, PHP, and Kotlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re now looking for a QA Automation Engineer to join the IntelliJ IDEA Java Build Tools QA team and help ensure the quality of a product that our customers and software engineers around the world rely on daily. Since most Java projects in IntelliJ IDEA are built with Maven or Gradle, Java Build Tools is a critical part of the IDE experience, and your work will affect how smoothly our users can open, sync, build, and run their projects. You&#39;ll work alongside QA engineers to design and set up our automation process for Gradle and Maven end-to-end tests, as well as implement and automate test scenarios that catch issues before they reach our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain multi-platform and environmental (Linux, Windows, MacOS, Docker, WSL) automated test scenarios.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand test coverage for new and existing functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug and troubleshoot test failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve existing automation based on team feedback and reduce test flakiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track quality metrics, including testing coverage, failure rate, and flakiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to frameworks and tools with product-specific extensions as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the team monitor test execution results and investigate failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in release quality assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with QA and developers to define test strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do manual QA activities when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the test documentation creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve domain-specific test infrastructure and CI/CD pipelines within your team&#39;s scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share automation best practices with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the tooling team to adopt new frameworks and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in test automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid programming skills in Kotlin/Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with test frameworks like JUnit or TestNG.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with build tools, like Maven and Gradle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of software testing principles and methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD tools (TeamCity or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with reporting tools (Allure or others).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Version control experience (Git).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in spoken and written English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsibility, self-discipline, and self-learning skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work independently, creatively, and on your own initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience testing developer tools, IDEs, and desktop applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with JVM Frameworks (Spring or Jakarta) and databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support. We help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior IT Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Mobile Device Management (MDM) Tribe at HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;. As a senior individual contributor, you will play a key role in designing, optimizing, and evolving our endpoint management environment across &lt;strong&gt;macOS, Windows, and mobile platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Intune, Jamf Pro&lt;/strong&gt; combined with a strong understanding of endpoint security, identity, automation, and modern device management practices. You will help shape our MDM strategy, drive technical improvements, and ensure a secure, scalable, and exceptional user experience.This is an &lt;strong&gt;Individual Contributor (IC)&lt;/strong&gt; role with a strong focus on technical ownership, architecture, automation, continuous improvement, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt;, implement, and continuously improve scalable MDM solutions across macOS, Windows, iOS, and Android, balancing security, compliance, and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define&lt;/strong&gt; and maintain MDM standards, policies, configuration profiles, application management, and compliance controls aligned with HelloFresh security and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt; PowerShell, Bash, and Microsoft Graph API to automate device management, compliance, reporting, remediation, and enforcement workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; meaningful reporting and analytics to monitor device health, compliance, application status, security posture, and fleet trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactively&lt;/strong&gt; identify risks, dependencies, and opportunities for improvement, and drive structured solutions from problem definition through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; and coach team members, promote knowledge sharing, and contribute to cross-training and continuous improvement across the MDM Tribe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong enterprise MDM experience with deep hands-on and architectural expertise in Microsoft Intune and Jamf Pro/Jamf Connect across macOS, Windows, iOS, and Android.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Good understanding of endpoint architecture and the broader technology ecosystem, including Microsoft Entra ID, Apple Business Manager, Windows Autopilot, Conditional Access, EDR, Zscaler, and privilege management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience with PowerShell and Bash scripting and the ability to automate endpoint management, remediation, and operational processes using Microsoft Graph API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of endpoint security principles, including encryption, compliance, device security, identity-driven access, and security controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to explain complex technical topics to audiences ranging from engineers to Directors and Senior Directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;A collaborative and egoless mindset with a willingness to share knowledge, mentor colleagues, and contribute to the technical growth of the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#IT&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will act as a trusted sparring partner to executives, steer complex transformation programs across functions, and drive organizational change at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead AI Transformation Programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer end-to-end execution of enterprise-level AI transformations. Identify internal champions, navigate corporate politics, manage structural blockers, and drive measurable user adoption and organizational change.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; AI Use Case Scoping:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders to answer high-stakes questions: How can AI reshape their business models? How should they govern data? You don&#39;t just advise; you help evaluate model choices, discuss data privacy trade-offs, and conceptualize technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Business Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively drive the growth of our German practice. Take ownership in lead generation and pipeline conversion by engaging prospective clients, shaping proposals, and leading pre-sales and key-account expansion initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Artefact&#39;s AI Transformation perspective externally. Advance our voice in enterprise AI through expert discussions, content creation (e.g. LinkedIn, whitepapers), and opinionated, hands-on perspectives on applied AI trends and real-world adoption pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance the Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve our methodologies, tools, and frameworks to keep our offering state-of-the-art. Develop reusable transformation playbooks and bring your strategic consulting or technology expertise into the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a senior advisor and role model - leading, coaching, and mentoring agile, hybrid project teams (consultants, data scientists, and engineers), fostering a fast-paced, “can-do” culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt; You are a true team player, eager to support others while scaling both the company and your own career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have approximately 5-8 years of full-time working experience in top-tier management consulting, technology consulting, or strategic corporate in-house roles. A proven track record of successfully leading and delivering data, analytics, or AI-driven transformation projects is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation &amp;amp; Change Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leading complex, cross-functional transformation programs, with the ability to manage executive stakeholders, navigate corporate politics, and embed AI capabilities within client organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency &amp;amp; &quot;Builder Mindset&quot;:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong fluency in modern and applied AI (e.g., GenAI, LLMs, agentic systems, automated workflows). While you don&#39;t need to be a full-time programmer, you have a hands-on understanding and can credibly demo working AI concepts and discuss data privacy and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge about common machine learning techniques, cloud architectures, and data management principles. Excellent quantitative skills to draw strategic insights from complex data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding communication, presentation, and moderation skills. You have a strong presence and can translate complex technical topics into compelling arguments for non-technical senior executives, as well as bridge the gap to technical execution teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent academic track record with a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluency in both German and English (written and spoken) is mandatory to successfully advise our German clients and lead workshops. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact sits uniquely at the crossroads of top-tier business strategy and deep tech. You will build boardroom-level strategy expertise while staying at the absolute forefront of AI, data management, and digital value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Entrepreneurial Freedom:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a fast-growing team in Germany, you will have high visibility from day one. You will directly help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region, bringing in your own ideas and driving business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Constant exposure to new AI solutions at the intersection of technology and business. Access to regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and the latest AI/data capabilities through our global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; We combine a high degree of self-assurance with a supportive, collaborative environment. We are entrepreneurial, fast-moving, and committed to delivering real impact - while strongly supporting each other&#39;s personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; &lt;em&gt;We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to send us a message at -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allow us to introduce ourselves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello there! We’re Appinio, a global market research company that combines an AI-powered insights platform with expert consultancy. On a mission to make the world a little more fact-based, we help companies understand how consumers think and make smarter decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started out in Hamburg back in 2014, but we’re now humbled to call the world our playground, with over &lt;strong&gt;260 employees&lt;/strong&gt; spread across &lt;strong&gt;13 countries &lt;/strong&gt;(we’re remote-first), 2600+ international clients, delivering research from &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;+190 markets,&lt;/strong&gt; globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to be a part of the Appinio movement? &lt;strong&gt;🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Here at Appinio, we value &lt;strong&gt;transparency&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;in our recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;ve created a blog to share what to expect during each step of our journey together:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ql-advanced-banner ql-advanced-banner-has-icon&quot; data-advanced-banner=&quot;78d3e0d3-6c50-47cd-bc1d-99bc1c575308&quot; data-advanced-banner-icon=&quot;{&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;emoji::📝&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;newAvatar&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;remove&amp;quot;}&quot; data-advanced-banner-color=&quot;yellow&quot;&gt;
