&lt;li&gt;Ability to bring data to life with stories and present with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for building trust and communicating effectively with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work autonomously and look for improvements in ways or working and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural ability to switch between different roles and wear different hats.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
